Subject: [PATCH 08/50] AnnaThermostat: add zone thermostat controls and
 read-only filtering

Use location-based zone ids/names for thermostat controls, map writes per zone to all writable thermostat devices, and skip read-only appliance types when creating thermostat control points.

Signed-off-by: Koen Kooi <koen@dominion.thruhere.net>

Assisted-by: GPT-5.3-Codex

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [WIP]
